            xmin = 331.48502 
            xmax = 332.22502 
            text = "" 
        intervals [128]:
            xmin = 332.22502 
            xmax = 334.962365815714 
            text = "crossways of the" 
        intervals [129]:
            xmin = 334.962365815714 
            xmax = 335.056123465918 
            text = "" 
        intervals [130]:
            xmin = 335.056123465918 
            xmax = 340.2 
            text = "carriage toward the saw the carriage ran back and forth right past the saw" 
        intervals [131]:
            xmin = 340.2 
            xmax = 341.82002 
            text = "" 
        intervals [132]:
            xmin = 341.82002 
            xmax = 348.44 
            text = "So the roller rolled a log onto the carriage and it was held there by two" 
        intervals [133]:
            xmin = 348.44 
            xmax = 349.10502 
            text = "" 
        intervals [134]:
            xmin = 349.10502 
            xmax = 351.382125969677 
            text = "heavy iron dog" 
        intervals [135]:
            xmin = 351.382125969677 
            xmax = 352.145 
            text = "" 
        intervals [136]:
            xmin = 352.145 
            xmax = 358.36502 
            text = "which was shot pointed and were raised up and down on steel posts" 
        intervals [137]:
            xmin = 358.36502 
            xmax = 359.50502 
            text = "" 
        intervals [138]:
            xmin = 359.50502 
            xmax = 364.685 
            text = "The roller would jam me two dogs into the log and this would hold it." 
        intervals [139]:
            xmin = 364.685 
            xmax = 365.74 
            text = "" 
        intervals [140]:
            xmin = 365.74 
            xmax = 375.47998 
            text = "The sawyer would then move the carriage over by means of a handle which he could pull on move the carriage over" 
        intervals [141]:
            xmin = 375.47998 
            xmax = 376.14 
            text = "" 
        intervals [142]:
            xmin = 376.14 
            xmax = 381.385 
            text = "so that ours would passed by the saw the saw would cut off" 
        intervals [143]:
            xmin = 381.385 
            xmax = 382.045 
            text = "" 
        intervals [144]:
            xmin = 382.045 
            xmax = 384.105 
            text = "a section of the log" 
        intervals [145]:
            xmin = 384.105 
            xmax = 385.245 
            text = "" 
        intervals [146]:
            xmin = 385.245 
            xmax = 393.39 
            text = "And the first section that was cut off was called the slab because this contained mostly bark" 
        intervals [147]:
            xmin = 393.39 
            xmax = 394.79002 
            text = "" 
        intervals [148]:
            xmin = 394.79002 
            xmax = 402.29 
            text = "And usually the way they did it was they would saw off the slab in other words take the first cut" 
        intervals [149]:
            xmin = 402.29 
            xmax = 403.03 
            text = "" 
        intervals [150]:
            xmin = 403.03 
            xmax = 409.81497 
            text = "Then the sawyer would run the carriage backwards and then move the carriage over" 
        intervals [151]:
            xmin = 409.81497 
            xmax = 411.515 
            text = "" 
        intervals [152]:
            xmin = 411.515 
            xmax = 419.335 
            text = "certain amount if he wanted a one inch board he would move it one inch if he wanted a two inch board he would move it two inches and so on" 
        intervals [153]:
            xmin = 419.335 
            xmax = 420.05 
            text = "" 
        intervals [154]:
            xmin = 420.05 
            xmax = 430.99 
            text = "And then he would run the carriage forward past the saw again and the saw would cut off whatever thickness of board the sawyer had moved the carriage for" 
        intervals [155]:
            xmin = 430.99 
            xmax = 431.65 
            text = "" 
        intervals [156]:
            xmin = 431.65 
            xmax = 433.38998 
            text = "After they'd taken off" 
        intervals [157]:
            xmin = 433.38998 
            xmax = 433.96998 
            text = "" 
        intervals [158]:
            xmin = 433.96998 
            xmax = 435.87 
            text = "several boards this way" 
        intervals [159]:
            xmin = 435.87 
            xmax = 437.03502 
            text = "" 
        intervals [160]:
            xmin = 437.03502 
            xmax = 438.295 
            text = "They would then" 
        intervals [161]:
            xmin = 438.295 
            xmax = 439.195 
            text = "" 
        intervals [162]:
            xmin = 439.195 
            xmax = 440.775 
            text = "roll the rod over" 
        intervals [163]:
            xmin = 440.775 
            xmax = 441.835 
            text = "" 
        intervals [164]:
            xmin = 441.835 
            xmax = 446.935 
            text = "So that the part which had already been sawed would be flat up against the carriage" 
        intervals [165]:
            xmin = 446.935 
            xmax = 447.75502 
            text = "" 
        intervals [166]:
            xmin = 447.75502 
            xmax = 455.67 
            text = "And this time the two rods were turned around so that a shorter bar would be holding the" 
        intervals [167]:
            xmin = 455.67 
            xmax = 456.89 
            text = "" 
        intervals [168]:
            xmin = 456.89 
            xmax = 462.63 
            text = "log in place on the carriage so that the saw could saw fairly close to the end" 
        intervals [169]:
            xmin = 462.63 
            xmax = 463.69 
            text = "" 
        intervals [170]:
            xmin = 463.69 
            xmax = 465.83002 
            text = "Then they would continue the process" 
        intervals [171]:
            xmin = 465.83002 
            xmax = 467.735 
            text = "" 
        intervals [172]:
            xmin = 467.735 
            xmax = 476.595 
            text = "of running the carriage forward past the saw a first cut would take off a slab and then the next cut would take off board which" 
        intervals [173]:
            xmin = 476.595 
            xmax = 477.335 
            text = "" 
        intervals [174]:
            xmin = 477.335 
            xmax = 482.55 
            text = "had round edges in other words they still had the bark on the two sides of them" 
        intervals [175]:
            xmin = 482.55 
            xmax = 483.37 
            text = "" 
        intervals [176]:
            xmin = 483.37 
            xmax = 487.11 
            text = "Now if they wanted to have square edge board" 
        intervals [177]:
            xmin = 487.11 
            xmax = 488.01 
            text = "" 
        intervals [178]:
            xmin = 488.01 
            xmax = 497.69498 
            text = "they would nearly cut four slabs off of the log leaving a four sided log which had no bark left on it at all" 
        intervals [179]:
            xmin = 497.69498 
            xmax = 498.195 
            text = "" 
        intervals [180]:
            xmin = 498.195 
            xmax = 501.055 
            text = "And they were then proceeded as before" 
        intervals [181]:
            xmin = 501.055 
            xmax = 501.71498 
            text = "" 
        intervals [182]:
            xmin = 501.71498 
            xmax = 505.31498 
            text = "and this would result in squarriage boards" 
        intervals [183]:
            xmin = 505.31498 
            xmax = 506.515 
            text = "" 
        intervals [184]:
            xmin = 506.515 
            xmax = 515.01 
            text = "Now as the carriage went past the saw the board which had been sawed off from the log would" 
        intervals [185]:
            xmin = 515.01 
            xmax = 515.51 
            text = "" 
        intervals [186]:
            xmin = 515.51 
            xmax = 517.81 
            text = "just fall over onto a bench" 
        intervals [187]:
            xmin = 517.81 
            xmax = 518.95 
            text = "" 
        intervals [188]:
            xmin = 518.95 
            xmax = 521.685045230404 
            text = "And then the marker would" 
        intervals [189]:
            xmin = 521.685045230404 
            xmax = 521.99 
            text = "" 
        intervals [190]:
            xmin = 521.99 
            xmax = 533.675 
            text = "mark on it the number of board feet in that board of course a board foot is a board one foot wide one foot long and one inch thick" 
        intervals [191]:
            xmin = 533.675 
            xmax = 534.655 
            text = "" 
        intervals [192]:
            xmin = 534.655 
            xmax = 538.39496 
            text = "So if you had a board which was ten feet long" 
        intervals [193]:
            xmin = 538.39496 
            xmax = 539.35 
            text = "" 
        intervals [194]:
            xmin = 539.35 
            xmax = 553.25 
            text = "one foot wide and one inch thick that board would have ten board feet in it and the marker would have a piece of heavy crayon and he would mark a ten on that board" 
        intervals [195]:
            xmin = 553.25 
            xmax = 553.625 
            text = "" 
        intervals [196]:
            xmin = 553.625 
            xmax = 562.40497 
            text = "If the board was the same size but two inches thick it would have twenty board feet in it and he'd mark a twenty on it and so on" 
        intervals [197]:
            xmin = 562.40497 
            xmax = 563.625 
            text = "" 
        intervals [198]:
            xmin = 563.625 
            xmax = 567.285 
            text = "He also had a peg board hanging on the wall" 
        intervals [199]:
            xmin = 567.285 
            xmax = 568.27 
            text = "" 
        intervals [200]:
            xmin = 568.27 
            xmax = 579.44995 
            text = "And by moving the pigs into different holes in this board he was able to keep track of the number of board feet of lumber that was sawed during the day by the mill" 
        intervals [201]:
            xmin = 579.44995 
            xmax = 579.74 
            text = "" 
        intervals [202]:
            xmin = 579.74 
            xmax = 585 
            text = "And on a good day they would saw several thousand board feet of lumber" 
