            xmax = 3281.47010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1022]:
            xmin = 3281.47010204082 
            xmax = 3288.65012204082 
            text = "And when I was twelve years old my dad began sending me out alone with the" 
        intervals [1023]:
            xmin = 3288.65012204082 
            xmax = 3288.91010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1024]:
            xmin = 3288.91010204082 
            xmax = 3299.31510204082 
            text = "truck down to the railroad station to get the freight in spite of the fact that I was not able to have a drivers license until I was sixteen" 
        intervals [1025]:
            xmin = 3299.31510204082 
            xmax = 3300.05510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1026]:
            xmin = 3300.05510204082 
            xmax = 3309.74010204082 
            text = "this used to bother my mother quite a lot she was afraid that somebody would report it but as far as I know no one ever did at least nothing was ever done about it anyway" 
        intervals [1027]:
            xmin = 3309.74010204082 
            xmax = 3310.24010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1028]:
            xmin = 3310.24010204082 
            xmax = 3319.69510204082 
            text = "But occasionally too I would use the horse and get down with him to the railroad station to draw freight up to the store" 
        intervals [1029]:
            xmin = 3319.69510204082 
            xmax = 3329.67510204082 
            text = "Of course I couldn't handle any big things like barrels of flour but I could handle things like cases of canned goods and things like that without any trouble" 
        intervals [1030]:
            xmin = 3329.67510204082 
            xmax = 3330.01512204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1031]:
            xmin = 3330.01512204082 
            xmax = 3337.23010204082 
            text = "When we had flour coming in my dad or the clerk would go with me to bring that up from the railroad station" 
        intervals [1032]:
            xmin = 3337.23010204082 
            xmax = 3342.77010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1033]:
            xmin = 3342.77010204082 
            xmax = 3350.48510204082 
            text = "Of course when I was quite small I really didn't enjoy working in the store very much but as I got older I" 
        intervals [1034]:
            xmin = 3350.48510204082 
            xmax = 3350.98510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1035]:
            xmin = 3350.98510204082 
            xmax = 3354.00510204082 
            text = "I got so that I tolerated it at least" 
        intervals [1036]:
            xmin = 3354.00510204082 
            xmax = 3354.74510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1037]:
            xmin = 3354.74510204082 
            xmax = 3359.12510204082 
            text = "Dad owned the truck for one month short of twenty years" 
        intervals [1038]:
            xmin = 3359.12510204082 
            xmax = 3359.62510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1039]:
            xmin = 3359.62510204082 
            xmax = 3363.04510204082 
            text = "from nineteen oh nine to nineteen twenty nine" 
        intervals [1040]:
            xmin = 3363.04510204082 
            xmax = 3364.51012204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1041]:
            xmin = 3364.51012204082 
            xmax = 3367.15010204082 
            text = "He had originally" 
        intervals [1042]:
            xmin = 3367.15010204082 
            xmax = 3370.09010204082 
            text = "worked for Otis Hager in his store" 
        intervals [1043]:
            xmin = 3370.09010204082 
            xmax = 3370.59010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1044]:
            xmin = 3370.59010204082 
            xmax = 3378.49012204082 
            text = "and then he bought this other store in North Dana which was of course in a competition with mister Hager" 
        intervals [1045]:
            xmin = 3378.49012204082 
            xmax = 3379.36510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1046]:
            xmin = 3379.36510204082 
            xmax = 3382.86512204082 
            text = "And kept it as I say for practically twenty years" 
        intervals [1047]:
            xmin = 3382.86512204082 
            xmax = 3383.60512204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1048]:
            xmin = 3383.60512204082 
            xmax = 3397.59010204082 
            text = "And as soon as he was out of the store business himself the very next week he went right back to work at Hager's store although by this time it was owned and operated by Lester Hager Otis' son." 
        intervals [1049]:
            xmin = 3397.59010204082 
            xmax = 3398.65010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1050]:
            xmin = 3398.65010204082 
            xmax = 3400.23010204082 
            text = "Although they were competitors" 
        intervals [1051]:
            xmin = 3400.23010204082 
            xmax = 3400.97010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1052]:
            xmin = 3400.97010204082 
            xmax = 3402.95010204082 
            text = "right there in the village" 
        intervals [1053]:
            xmin = 3402.95010204082 
            xmax = 3404.00510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1054]:
            xmin = 3404.00510204082 
            xmax = 3404.94510204082 
            text = "There were" 
        intervals [1055]:
            xmin = 3404.94510204082 
            xmax = 3405.60512204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1056]:
            xmin = 3405.60512204082 
            xmax = 3408.78510204082 
            text = "at times as many as four" 
        intervals [1057]:
            xmin = 3408.78510204082 
            xmax = 3409.60512204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1058]:
            xmin = 3409.60512204082 
            xmax = 3418.36008204082 
            text = "stores selling groceries in North Dana and always there were at least two stores Hager's and Doubleday's so although" 
        intervals [1059]:
            xmin = 3418.36008204082 
            xmax = 3418.94008204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1060]:
            xmin = 3418.94008204082 
            xmax = 3420.12010204082 
            text = "we were competitors" 
        intervals [1061]:
            xmin = 3420.12010204082 
            xmax = 3421.26010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1062]:
            xmin = 3421.26010204082 
            xmax = 3423.80008204082 
            text = "we all still remained friends" 
        intervals [1063]:
            xmin = 3423.80008204082 
            xmax = 3424.70010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1064]:
            xmin = 3424.70010204082 
            xmax = 3436.72510204082 
            text = "and we frequently checked with each other to make sure that neither one was charging prices which were very much higher or very much lower than the other one" 
        intervals [1065]:
            xmin = 3436.72510204082 
            xmax = 3437.06510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1066]:
            xmin = 3437.06510204082 
            xmax = 3451.86010204082 
            text = "And also if we had an order for a certain article and we were temporarily out of it well we would stop over to Lester's Hager's store and pick up the article and he would do the same if he was out of something temporarily" 
        intervals [1067]:
            xmin = 3451.86010204082 
            xmax = 3453.32010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1068]:
            xmin = 3453.32010204082 
            xmax = 3463.80512204082 
            text = "In fact the two families my parents and Lester Hager and his wife used to socialize quite regularly" 
        intervals [1069]:
            xmin = 3463.80512204082 
            xmax = 3464.46510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1070]:
            xmin = 3464.46510204082 
            xmax = 3466.36512204082 
            text = "outside of store hours" 
        intervals [1071]:
            xmin = 3466.36512204082 
            xmax = 3467.42513204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1072]:
            xmin = 3467.42513204082 
            xmax = 3482.41512204082 
            text = "They and two other couples had a little bridge club in town a bridge club and they used to get together quite regularly to play bridge and I recall on time my father and mother and Lester and Marion Hager" 
        intervals [1073]:
            xmin = 3482.41512204082 
            xmax = 3484.71512204082 
            text = "took a vacation trip together" 
        intervals [1074]:
            xmin = 3484.71512204082 
            xmax = 3485.29512204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1075]:
            xmin = 3485.29512204082 
            xmax = 3487.27512204082 
            text = "So the competition was" 
        intervals [1076]:
            xmin = 3487.27512204082 
            xmax = 3487.93510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1077]:
            xmin = 3487.93510204082 
            xmax = 3489.91510204082 
            text = "all was a friendly competition" 
        intervals [1078]:
            xmin = 3489.91510204082 
            xmax = 3491.61510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1079]:
            xmin = 3491.61510204082 
            xmax = 3500.04010204082 
            text = "In nineteen twenty nine my father sold out to the metropolitan mystic water supply commission" 
        intervals [1080]:
            xmin = 3500.04010204082 
            xmax = 3501.50010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1081]:
            xmin = 3501.50010204082 
            xmax = 3509.00010204082 
            text = "and he sold all of his property in one lump sum he owned a couple of houses and" 
        intervals [1082]:
            xmin = 3509.00010204082 
            xmax = 3509.67510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1083]:
            xmin = 3509.67510204082 
            xmax = 3516.77510204082 
            text = "one or two timber lots and the store business and this all went for one price there was no" 
        intervals [1084]:
            xmin = 3516.77510204082 
            xmax = 3518.39510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1085]:
            xmin = 3518.39510204082 
            xmax = 3523.54776460435 
            text = "way to distinguish how much you receive for any one of the units" 
        intervals [1086]:
            xmin = 3523.54776460435 
            xmax = 3524.41014204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1087]:
            xmin = 3524.41014204082 
            xmax = 3527.99015204082 
            text = "But he always figured that either you" 
        intervals [1088]:
            xmin = 3527.99015204082 
            xmax = 3528.73015204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1089]:
            xmin = 3528.73015204082 
            xmax = 3532.63010204082 
            text = "could say that he got a low price for everything" 
        intervals [1090]:
            xmin = 3532.63010204082 
            xmax = 3534.09013204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1091]:
            xmin = 3534.09013204082 
            xmax = 3547.30515204082 
            text = "or that he got a good fair price for his real estate and nothing for his store business but in any event he probably did not receive anywhere near as much as he" 
        intervals [1092]:
            xmin = 3547.30515204082 
            xmax = 3547.88510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1093]:
            xmin = 3547.88510204082 
            xmax = 3557.54010204082 
            text = "really should have and could have had he taken the matter to court but he figured that in the long run he would be better off not going to court" 
        intervals [1094]:
            xmin = 3557.54010204082 
            xmax = 3558.68010204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1095]:
            xmin = 3558.68010204082 
            xmax = 3561.38010204082 
            text = "After he sold out to the state" 
        intervals [1096]:
            xmin = 3561.38010204082 
            xmax = 3563.88005204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1097]:
            xmin = 3563.88005204082 
            xmax = 3569.59507204082 
            text = "we continued to live in the same house that we had been living in he rented it from the state" 
        intervals [1098]:
            xmin = 3569.59507204082 
            xmax = 3570.17510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1099]:
            xmin = 3570.17510204082 
            xmax = 3570.87510204082 
            text = "And" 
        intervals [1100]:
            xmin = 3570.87510204082 
            xmax = 3571.37510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1101]:
            xmin = 3571.37510204082 
            xmax = 3573.11510204082 
            text = "he and my mother" 
        intervals [1102]:
            xmin = 3573.11510204082 
            xmax = 3573.69510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1103]:
            xmin = 3573.69510204082 
            xmax = 3574.87510204082 
            text = "and my sister" 
        intervals [1104]:
            xmin = 3574.87510204082 
            xmax = 3575.53510204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1105]:
            xmin = 3575.53510204082 
            xmax = 3580.47510204082 
            text = "lived there until nineteen thirty eight that same place" 
        intervals [1106]:
            xmin = 3580.47510204082 
            xmax = 3582.00017204082 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1107]:
            xmin = 3582.00017204082 
            xmax = 3586.86020204082 
            text = "People frequently ask what did you do for amusement there" 
        intervals [1108]:
            xmin = 3586.86020204082 
            xmax = 3587.54517006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1109]:
            xmin = 3587.54517006803 
            xmax = 3588.06517003803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1110]:
            xmin = 3588.06517003803 
            xmax = 3596.92517006803 
            text = "Well of course we did not have television in those days but we did have radio after nineteen twenty two anyway" 
        intervals [1111]:
            xmin = 3596.92517006803 
            xmax = 3597.98516906803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1112]:
            xmin = 3597.98516906803 
            xmax = 3601.258082298499 
            text = "And there were such things as the grange" 
        intervals [1113]:
            xmin = 3601.258082298499 
            xmax = 3601.66517006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1114]:
            xmin = 3601.66517006803 
            xmax = 3604.61017006803 
            text = "Of course that met twice a month" 
        intervals [1115]:
            xmin = 3604.61017006803 
            xmax = 3606.07017006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1116]:
            xmin = 3606.07017006803 
            xmax = 3610.53017006803 
            text = "And nearly everyone in the village belonged to that it was" 
        intervals [1117]:
            xmin = 3610.53017006803 
            xmax = 3612.39017006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1118]:
            xmin = 3612.39017006803 
            xmax = 3620.02517006803 
            text = "a regular social event but then you also had church sponsored events like parties and" 
        intervals [1119]:
            xmin = 3620.02517006803 
            xmax = 3620.84517006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1120]:
            xmin = 3620.84517006803 
            xmax = 3633.18017006803 
            text = "things of that sort and then you had private parties birthday parties and halloween parties and things like that and of course we could play cards" 
        intervals [1121]:
            xmin = 3633.18017006803 
            xmax = 3634.56017006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1122]:
            xmin = 3634.56017006803 
            xmax = 3639.18017006803 
            text = "And in season we did a lot of hunting and fishing" 
        intervals [1123]:
            xmin = 3639.18017006803 
            xmax = 3640.24017006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1124]:
            xmin = 3640.24017006803 
            xmax = 3641.74017006803 
            text = "swimming in the summertime" 
        intervals [1125]:
            xmin = 3641.74017006803 
            xmax = 3642.96016806803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1126]:
            xmin = 3642.96016806803 
            xmax = 3657.69517006803 
            text = "My folks build a camp on Lake Meesataunsett which was about a mile from the village so that we were able to just move up there and live there all summer long and operate the grocery store from there" 
        intervals [1127]:
            xmin = 3657.69517006803 
            xmax = 3658.19517006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1128]:
            xmin = 3658.19517006803 
            xmax = 3668.74017006803 
            text = "Mother used to come down to the village on Mondays and do the family washing because we had the electric washing machine at home of course" 
        intervals [1129]:
            xmin = 3668.74017006803 
            xmax = 3670.92625426469 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1130]:
            xmin = 3670.92625426469 
            xmax = 3671.539609778 
            text = "but" 
        intervals [1131]:
            xmin = 3671.539609778 
            xmax = 3672.20016606803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1132]:
            xmin = 3672.20016606803 
            xmax = 3685.53517006803 
            text = "I enjoyed that those summers at camp although of course we were pretty busy in the store so we didn't have too much leisure time but we we had time to go fishing once in a while" 
        intervals [1133]:
            xmin = 3685.53517006803 
            xmax = 3686.09017006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1134]:
            xmin = 3686.09017006803 
            xmax = 3689.27017606803 
            text = "And as I said we did a lot of hunting too" 
        intervals [1135]:
            xmin = 3689.27017606803 
            xmax = 3690.25017006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1136]:
            xmin = 3690.25017006803 
            xmax = 3691.99017006803 
            text = "around the area" 
        intervals [1137]:
            xmin = 3691.99017006803 
            xmax = 3692.81017406803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1138]:
            xmin = 3692.81017406803 
            xmax = 3701.85517006803 
            text = "My dad used to enjoy hunting partridges very much and we could take one or two afternoons a week off" 
        intervals [1139]:
            xmin = 3701.85517006803 
            xmax = 3702.51517006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1140]:
            xmin = 3702.51517006803 
            xmax = 3715.73017006803 
            text = "most of the afternoon anyway from the store in partridge season and we had a lot of different covers if we could go through and ask for another and drive from one to another in a car" 
        intervals [1141]:
            xmin = 3715.73017006803 
            xmax = 3716.23017006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1142]:
            xmin = 3716.23017006803 
            xmax = 3717.65017006803 
            text = "in that way why" 
        intervals [1143]:
            xmin = 3717.65017006803 
            xmax = 3718.15018006803 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1144]:
            xmin = 3718.15018006803 
            xmax = 3725.57017006803 
            text = "you could hunt all day long if you had the opportunity because once you went through the" 
        intervals [1145]:
            xmin = 3725.57017006803 
            xmax = 3726.80671693436 
            text = "" 
        intervals [1146]:
            xmin = 3726.80671693436 
            xmax = 3737.12517006803 
            text = "list of covers that we had where you could go back and start over again and you could cover them maybe two or three times the same day and and still see plenty of partridge" 
        intervals [1147]:
            xmin = 3737.12517006803 
            xmax = 3770.62498866213 
            text = "" 
